<html>
<style type="text/css">
    body {
        background: #ededed;
    }

    .container {
        margin: 10px auto;
        width: 600px;
    }

    /*-- Email CSS --*/

    .mexemeailtheme {
        background-color: #fff;
        font-family: Arial;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailhead {
        background-color: ##003a70;
        padding: 3px 5px 5px 5px;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeaillogo {
        padding-left: 35px;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeaillogo p {
        font-family: Arial;
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: 22px;
        color: #fff;
    }

    .mexemeaillogo p>sup {
        font-size: 15px;
    }

    .mexemeailphoto {
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailphoto img {
        max-width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailcontent {
        background-color: #fff;
        padding: 10px 30px;
        overflow: hidden;
        color: #5e5e5e;
        width: 90%;
    }

    .mexemeailcontent p {
        line-height: 26px;
        font-size: 18px;
        color: #5e5e5e;
    }

    .mexemeailbut {
        background-color: #cdcdcd;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 15px 35px;
        border-radius: 30px;
        width: max-content;
        margin: 10px 0px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 18px;
        display: block;
        color: #fff;
    }

    .mexemeailbut:hover,
    .mexemeailbut:focus {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .mexemeailsocial {
        padding: 15px 35px 35px 35px;
        background-color: #e2e2e2;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailsocial h3 {
        color: #5e5e5e;
    }

    .mexemico {
        background-size: 100% !important;
        margin-right: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
        display: block;
        float: left;
    }

    .mexemico:hover,
    .mexemico:focus {
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    /*.mexemailfaceboock{
                    background:url(https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/emailfaceboock.png) no-repeat;
                }
                
                .mexemailinstagram{
                    background:url(https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/emailinstagram.png) no-repeat;
                }
                
                .mexemailtweeter{
                    background:url(https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/emailtweeter.png) no-repeat;
                }*/

    .mexemeailfooter {
        background-color: #003a70;
        padding: 25px 35px;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter p {
        line-height: 26px;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #e2e2e2;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter p>a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter p>a:hover,
    .mexemeailfooter p>a:focus {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter a:hover,
    .mexemeailfooter a:focus {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }
</style>

<body>
    <div style="background-color:#fff;font-family:Arial;overflow:hidden;width:100%;">
        <div style="display:flex; background-color:#fff; padding:20px 0; ">
            <p style="margin:Auto;"><img
                    src="https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Icon.png"
                    width="110" /></p>
        </div>
        
        <div style="background-color:#fff;padding:30px;overflow:hidden;color:#5e5e5e;width:90%;"
class="mexemeailcontent">

<!--<h2 style="line-height:26px;font-size:18px;color:#5e5e5e;">Partnership Opportunities Await – Please Review Our NDA</h2>-->

            <p style="line-height:26px;font-size:18px;color:#5e5e5e;">

            <p>Dear {!Lead.FirstName},</p>
            <p>Congratulations! We are thrilled to offer you a contract to start writing Mexico Insurance on the MexInsurance platform.</p>

<p><strong>OFFER DETAILS:</strong>
<ul><li>
Approved Product(s): 'PRODUCT'</li>
<li>Approved Company: 'CARRIER'</li>
<li>Approved Medium: 'PLATFORM'</li></ul><br>
Your Monthly Commitment: 'COMMITMENT'<br>
Monthly Fee: 'RECURRING'<br>
Setup Charge: 'SETUP'<br></p>
<p><strong>COMPENSATION:</strong><ul><li>
Product Commission Auto: 'AGENCY_COMM_AUTO_NEW'</li>
<li>Product Commission RV: 'AGENCY_COMM_RV_NEW'</li>
<li>Product Commission Motorcycle: 'AGENCY_COMM_MOTO_NEW'</li>
<li>Product Commission Watercraft: 'AGENCY_COMM_WATER_NEW'</li></ul><br></p>
<p>NEXT STEPS:<br></p>
<p>Your contract is available <a href=””>here</a>.</p>
<p>Once signed, you will receive a welcome letter with a link to activate your online portal account, enabling you to start writing Mexico insurance in minutes!</p>
<p>Congratulations again on your success. Your reputable agency and dedication are highly valued, and we look forward to a fruitful partnership.</p>
<br><p>Respectfully,</p>
<br>Charles Lundy
<br>CEO
<br>MexInsurance

         </div>
            
             
                    <div style="background-color:#fff;padding:6px 0;overflow:hidden;width:100%;"
                        class="mexemeailfooter">
                        <div style="display:flex;">
                            <p style="margin:Auto;"><img
                                    src="https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/mexinsurance-colorful-logo-2.png"
                                    width="175" /></p>
                        </div>

                        <div style="display:flex">
                            <p style="margin:Auto;color:#000; padding-top: 2px; font-size: 14px;">&copy; MEXINSURANCE SOLUTIONS, INC.</p>
                        </div>

                                               

                       
                    </div>
        </div>
    
</body>

</html>